{"id": "EUVD-2026-102282", "enisaUuid": "bac02f47-49fb-3b34-8c63-1e3bd5fa67f8", "description": "libTiMidity through 0.2.8 contains a heap out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the SoundFont loader in src/sndfont.c that uses unvalidated sampleId and instrument generator values as table indices. Attackers can supply a crafted .sf2 file loaded through mid_set_soundfont() to read heap memory out of bounds and crash the application.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T01:23:29", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/libtimidity-soundfont-generator-oper-oob-write", "https://github.com/sezero/libtimidity/blob/a52adf6aee2635e2a16797213a089c2180e67757/src/sndfont.c#L578-L590", "https://github.com/sezero/libtimidity", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libtimidity-through-0.2.8-out-of-bounds-read-via-soundfont-loader-sndfont-c"], "aliases": ["GHSA-g425-c86q-2452", "CVE-2026-111155"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "e902f414-2d4b-35e9-a7ba-0b13b2728cdc", "product": {"name": "libtimidity", "vendor": {"name": "sezero"}}, "product_version": "0.2.8 \u22640.2.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "80f497ee-d607-3732-add1-e8fc8871c42a", "vendor": {"name": "sezero"}}], "isExploited": false}